          %title
          %p
            Neil Lambert is professor for theoretical
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/physics"} physics
            at King’s College London.
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "http://www.kcl.ac.uk/nms/depts/mathematics/people/atoz/lambertn.aspx"} webpage
          %h2#selected_writings Selected writings
          %p
            On obtaining
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/massive+type+IIA+supergravity"} massive type IIA supergravity
            from a form o
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D11+supergravity"} D=11 supergravity
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+S.+Howe"}> Paul S. Howe
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+D.+Lambert"} Neil D. Lambert
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+C.+West"} Peter C. West
              = succeed "," do
                %em A New Massive Type IIA Supergravity From Compactification
              %strong 416
              (1998) 303-308 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9707139"}> arXiv:hep-th/9707139
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0370-2693(97)01199-4"} doi:10.1016/S0370-2693(97)01199-4
          %p
            On the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/3-brane+in+6d"} 3-brane in 6d
            as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black brane
            in an
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/NS5-brane"} NS5-brane
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldvolume"} worldvolume
          %ul
            %li#HoweLambertWest97
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Howe"}> Paul Howe
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"} Neil Lambert
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Threebrane Soliton of the M-Fivebrane
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9710033"} arXiv:hep-th/9710033
          %p
            and of its relation to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D4+N%3D2+super+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=4 N=2 super Yang-Mills theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Howe"}> Paul Howe
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"} Neil Lambert
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Classical M-Fivebrane Dynamics and Quantum
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi N
                          %mo =
                          %mn 2
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N=2
                    Yang-Mills
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9710034"} arXiv:hep-th/9710034
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Gauge Fields and M-Fivebrane Dynamics
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9712040"} arXiv:hep-th/9712040
            %li#LambertWest98
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi N
                          %mo =
                          %mn 2
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N=2
                    Superfields and the M-Fivebrane
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9801104"} arXiv:hep-th/9801104
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Monopole Dynamics from the M-Fivebrane
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9811025"} arXiv:hep-th/9811025
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dp-D%28p%2B2%29+brane+intersections"} Dp-D(p+2) brane intersections
            (such as
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D1-D3+brane+intersections"} D1-D3 brane intersections
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BIons"} BIons
            from the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Howe"}> Paul Howe
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"} Neil Lambert
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"} Peter West
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Self-Dual String Soliton
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9709014"} arXiv:hep-th/9709014
          %p
            On multiple
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-branes"} M2-branes
            and the
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BLG+model"} BLG model
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ABJM+model"} ABJM model
            of their
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldvolume"} worldvolume
            theory:
          %ul
            %li#BaggerLambert06
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Bagger"}> Jonathan Bagger
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"} Neil Lambert
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Modeling Multiple M2’s
                = succeed ")." do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0611108"} hep-th/0611108
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Bagger"}> Jonathan Bagger
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"} Neil Lambert
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Gauge Symmetry and Supersymmetry of Multiple M2-Branes
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arXiv.org/abs/0711.0955"} arXiv:0711.0955
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Tong"} David Tong
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Membranes on an Orbifold
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0804.1114"} arXiv:0804.1114
            %li#BaggerLambertMukhiPapageorgakis13
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonathan+Bagger"}> Jonathan Bagger
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"} Neil Lambert
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sunil+Mukhi"} Sunil Mukhi
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Constantinos+Papageorgakis"} Constantinos Papageorgakis
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Multiple Membranes in M-theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1203.3546"} arXiv:1203.3546
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physrep.2013.01.006"} doi:10.1016/j.physrep.2013.01.006
            %li#Lambert12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em M-Theory and Maximally Supersymmetric Gauge Theories
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1203.4244"} arXiv:1203.4244
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1146/annurev-nucl-102010-130248"} doi:10.1146/annurev-nucl-102010-130248
            %li#Lambert18
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Lessons from M2’s and Hopes for M5’s
                %em
                  Proceedings of the
                  = succeed ":" do
                    %a{:href => "http://www.maths.dur.ac.uk/lms/"} LMS-EPSRC Durham Symposium
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Higher+Structures+in+M-Theory+2018"} Higher Structures in M-Theory 2018
                Fortschritte der Physik, 2019 (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1903.02825"}> arXiv:1903.02825
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.maths.dur.ac.uk/lms/109/talks/1877lambert.pdf"} slides pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.maths.dur.ac.uk/lms/109/movies/1877lamb.mp4"} video recording
          %p
            and specifically in relation to
